1
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,058
Sorry, Nagisa.

2
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,893
I just remembered
I have to go do something.

3
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:22,313
Okay, got it.

4
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:30,321
{\an8}EIMEI PRIVATE HIGH SCHOOL

5
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:55,096
DECORATIONS

6
00:01:26,711 --> 00:01:28,712
You scared me half to death!

7
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:30,589
Don't sneak up on me like that!

8
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:34,176
- Sorry.
- I thought you were a ghost.

9
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:36,012
Not Santa Claus?

10
00:01:36,638 --> 00:01:37,514
What?

11
00:01:47,106 --> 00:01:50,192
Wait, what are you doing here?

12
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:51,528
How did the game go?

13
00:01:53,613 --> 00:01:55,281
We made it through the first round.

14
00:01:56,866 --> 00:01:58,284
Congratulations.

15
00:01:59,077 --> 00:02:00,286
Thank you.

16
00:02:00,912 --> 00:02:03,289
Also, thank you for the ticket.

17
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:09,337
I was able to patch things up with Yumeka
thanks to you.

18
00:02:13,925 --> 00:02:17,804
I heard you ran a whole lot
to get that ticket.

19
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:19,388
What?

20
00:02:19,389 --> 00:02:21,307
It was nothing!

21
00:02:21,891 --> 00:02:23,685
It was just some light running.

22
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,482
I've actually known for a long time.

23
00:02:30,775 --> 00:02:33,528
<i>That Yumeka was struggling with something.</i>

24
00:02:34,946 --> 00:02:40,410
But I never said anything
because she never brought it up.

25
00:02:56,509 --> 00:02:58,553
And I really regretted that.

26
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:04,100
But today, I was able
to deal with some of that regret.

27
00:03:05,268 --> 00:03:09,439
So I'm really grateful to you, Taiki.

28
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:16,821
From the bottom of my heart.

29
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:23,953
You don't have to... thank me.

30
00:03:29,876 --> 00:03:34,297
Just like Yumeka influenced you,

31
00:03:35,423 --> 00:03:38,676
you've influenced me.

32
00:03:40,386 --> 00:03:42,430
All I did was repay the favor!

33
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,151
Thank you.

34
00:05:07,515 --> 00:05:08,433
Sorry.

35
00:05:14,772 --> 00:05:15,940
Let me just...

36
00:05:17,358 --> 00:05:18,860
hug you for a little bit.

37
00:05:57,482 --> 00:06:01,652
BLUE BOX SEASON 2

38
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:28,656
EPISODE 31
CHRISTMAS EVE

39
00:08:23,461 --> 00:08:24,462
Thanks.

40
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,176
It's fine.

41
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:45,358
Hey...

42
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,485
Chinatsu Senpai...

43
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:54,992
We should get going.

44
00:08:56,911 --> 00:08:57,995
What?

45
00:09:03,334 --> 00:09:04,669
Chinatsu?

46
00:09:13,052 --> 00:09:15,638
<i>What was that just now?</i>

47
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:19,725
<i>She... She hugged me!</i>

48
00:09:21,477 --> 00:09:24,063
<i>I can still feel her warmth
on my shoulder.</i>

49
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:32,737
<i>Maybe she was just nervous
about tomorrow's game</i>

50
00:09:32,738 --> 00:09:34,991
<i>and wanted reassurance from somebody.</i>

51
00:09:35,992 --> 00:09:39,412
<i>Or did making up with Yumeka</i>

52
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:41,789
<i>make her feel a bit emotional?</i>

53
00:09:43,124 --> 00:09:44,166
<i>Or maybe...</i>

54
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:48,378
Yo, Taiki!

55
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:50,298
Come over here!

56
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,389
<i>Could it be?</i>

57
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:37,678
Mom! Where's Chinatsu Senpai?

58
00:10:38,387 --> 00:10:40,097
She left ages ago.

59
00:10:40,890 --> 00:10:43,017
Her second-round game starts at 1:00 p.m.

60
00:10:43,851 --> 00:10:45,185
Right.

61
00:10:45,186 --> 00:10:47,687
Don't you have badminton practice
this afternoon?

62
00:10:47,688 --> 00:10:49,606
Hurry up and get ready.

63
00:10:49,607 --> 00:10:50,858
Okay.

64
00:11:04,205 --> 00:11:07,458
- What are you spacing out about?
- Nothing!

65
00:11:08,584 --> 00:11:10,211
I need to stop by the club room!

66
00:11:18,135 --> 00:11:21,263
<i>I can't stop thinking about yesterday.</i>

67
00:11:25,351 --> 00:11:29,897
<i>I wanted to ask her more about Yumeka.</i>

68
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:34,527
<i>Now that they've made up,
is she going to play basketball again?</i>

69
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:39,156
<i>I bet that would make
Chinatsu Senpai happy.</i>

70
00:11:40,991 --> 00:11:42,368
<i>So happy that she...</i>

71
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:48,290
<i>I keep thinking about it!</i>

72
00:11:49,125 --> 00:11:51,544
Is there something wrong with you
other than your teeth?

73
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:05,182
Yumeka, your hair...

74
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:10,187
You know, it's cold having short hair
this time of year.

75
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,191
But it gets in the way
when playing basketball.

76
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:19,488
I may be rusty,

77
00:12:20,072 --> 00:12:23,075
but I was thinking of joining
my school's basketball team.

78
00:12:24,285 --> 00:12:25,827
I see.

79
00:12:25,828 --> 00:12:30,499
I'll have to grind like crazy
if I'm going to catch up to Natsu.

80
00:12:32,918 --> 00:12:36,172
<i>Did I just bring back a formidable enemy...?</i>

81
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:41,050
That's why you have to make sure
you support Natsu,

82
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,761
so she doesn't waste time like I did.

83
00:12:43,637 --> 00:12:45,264
You're her boyfriend, after all.

84
00:12:49,852 --> 00:12:52,271
- We're not together!
- What?!

85
00:12:53,063 --> 00:12:55,774
You've got the wrong idea!

86
00:12:56,484 --> 00:12:58,777
You got a boyfriend too?

87
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:01,989
<i>Wait, did I not correct her?</i>

88
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,158
What?!

89
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:08,203
So you're not even Natsu's boyfriend,

90
00:13:08,204 --> 00:13:12,124
yet you went through all that trouble
just to bring me a ticket to her game?

91
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,502
Sorry.

92
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:17,338
You do have feelings for Natsu, don't you?

93
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:19,924
Well...

94
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,009
Did she reject you or something?

95
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:26,013
I haven't told her my feelings yet.

96
00:13:26,722 --> 00:13:28,766
You're one chicken burger coward.

97
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:32,269
Why a burger?

98
00:13:32,895 --> 00:13:36,148
But I suppose Natsu's hard to figure out.

99
00:13:37,066 --> 00:13:39,652
I mean, I didn't think
she was interested in dating at all.

100
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:41,946
That's the thing.

101
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:45,241
Stop making excuses.

102
00:13:53,666 --> 00:13:56,252
<i>Love is the most powerful feeling,
you know?</i>

103
00:13:59,088 --> 00:14:01,507
{\an8}<i>The next day, in the third round,</i>

104
00:14:02,466 --> 00:14:05,260
{\an8}<i>Chinatsu Senpai
and the girls' basketball team lost.</i>

105
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:09,264
{\an8}<i>Their opponent went on
to win the tournament.</i>

106
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:11,684
<i>Still, despite the frustrating defeat,</i>

107
00:14:12,309 --> 00:14:16,397
<i>the tournament left them feeling
like they'd come further than last time.</i>

108
00:14:17,773 --> 00:14:21,318
<i>In the midst of everything,
I couldn't find the time to ask her...</i>

109
00:14:22,778 --> 00:14:25,781
<i>what that hug really meant.</i>

110
00:14:40,838 --> 00:14:44,632
Your parents are arriving in Japan
at 8:00 p.m., right?

111
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:48,136
Right. So I'm thinking about
leaving at six o'clock to meet them.

112
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:51,432
Then you're going
to visit your grandpa in Nagano,

113
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,934
and you'll be there until New Year's?

114
00:14:54,602 --> 00:14:56,979
We're going to miss you!

115
00:14:57,521 --> 00:14:58,771
Good morning.

116
00:14:58,772 --> 00:15:03,027
What's up with that bedhead?
Get it together!

117
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:13,871
I'll go wash my hair!

118
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:16,582
You'll go bald if you wash it too much.

119
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:26,592
<i>How am I supposed to act around her?!</i>

120
00:15:27,176 --> 00:15:30,054
<i>I can't talk to her at home
with Mom around all the time.</i>

121
00:15:36,268 --> 00:15:37,561
<i>At this rate...</i>

122
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,777
Time for the end-of-year deep clean.

123
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,654
I want this place to be spotless!

124
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:49,448
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

125
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:55,454
Taiki, that area's already done,
so could you help out somewhere else?

126
00:15:56,038 --> 00:15:56,956
Got it!

127
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:07,967
<i>When I look at her,
it's like nothing ever happened.</i>

128
00:16:08,801 --> 00:16:10,803
<i>Did I just dream up the whole thing?</i>

129
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:19,018
Why don't we just keep that up
all year round?

130
00:16:19,019 --> 00:16:21,230
- What?
- Hey, you!

131
00:16:22,272 --> 00:16:23,983
Don't wipe in a circular motion!

132
00:16:24,566 --> 00:16:27,193
You have to move your hands up and down
in a straight line!

133
00:16:27,194 --> 00:16:29,238
And don't miss the dust in the corner!

134
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:32,740
{\an8}Show yourself, evil stains!

135
00:16:32,741 --> 00:16:35,201
{\an8}The manager is surprisingly
nitpicky about cleaning.

136
00:16:35,202 --> 00:16:37,578
{\an8}At first, I was happy
we got a cute manager,

137
00:16:37,579 --> 00:16:38,998
{\an8}but she's stricter than my mom!

138
00:16:39,581 --> 00:16:42,333
- Stop loitering around, Inota.
- I was just...

139
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:46,255
If you're done with your task,
go check on the equipment!

140
00:16:51,844 --> 00:16:55,264
<i>Hard to believe this is the same place
we spent that Christmas Eve.</i>

141
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:58,350
<i>Maybe I really did just dream it up.</i>

142
00:17:01,937 --> 00:17:03,022
Hey, kid.

143
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:04,981
Good work.

144
00:17:04,982 --> 00:17:06,734
Thanks, you too.

145
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:10,778
Looks like we have everything here.

146
00:17:10,779 --> 00:17:12,488
I think you're right.

147
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:13,490
Yeah.

148
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:15,534
<i>See?</i>

149
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:18,454
<i>Chinatsu Senpai's acting normal.</i>

150
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:21,456
<i>Like the hug never happened.</i>

151
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:23,042
Excuse me, coming through.

152
00:17:35,345 --> 00:17:36,472
Sorry!

153
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:39,850
Don't be, I don't mind.

154
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:41,935
Sorry.

155
00:17:44,563 --> 00:17:47,398
I'll go turn this in.
Can you take care of things here?

156
00:17:47,399 --> 00:17:48,400
Sure.

157
00:18:00,537 --> 00:18:02,998
About what happened before...

158
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:07,294
Did it offend you?

159
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:18,180
<i>No, it didn't...</i>

160
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:22,850
- I...
- Hey!

161
00:18:22,851 --> 00:18:25,604
They've brought juice for us!

162
00:18:34,071 --> 00:18:35,781
<i>Of course it didn't offend me!</i>

163
00:18:37,282 --> 00:18:38,408
<i>Not at all.</i>

164
00:18:40,369 --> 00:18:41,453
<i>You got it wrong!</i>

165
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:53,924
Could you help me carry these, Chono?

166
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,800
What?

167
00:18:55,801 --> 00:18:57,052
To the teacher's lounge.

168
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,055
They're pretty heavy.

169
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:04,433
Sure, I guess.
I didn't know you were so weak.

170
00:19:04,434 --> 00:19:07,146
- You work out, though.
- And you don't?

171
00:19:20,159 --> 00:19:23,161
It feels good to clean the place up!

172
00:19:23,162 --> 00:19:25,079
- You guys want to grab--
- See you later!

173
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,081
Hey!

174
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,171
<i>I have to tell her!</i>

175
00:19:35,215 --> 00:19:36,592
<i>That it didn't offend me.</i>

176
00:19:38,302 --> 00:19:39,428
<i>That it made me happy.</i>

177
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:44,349
<i>I mean, it was the first time
that someone I like hugged me!</i>

178
00:20:22,763 --> 00:20:25,224
Oh, thank you.

179
00:20:50,666 --> 00:20:54,544
<i>I haven't been able to stop thinking
about that moment ever since.</i>

180
00:21:01,343 --> 00:21:02,344
<i>But...</i>

181
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,141
<i>But...</i>

182
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:15,565
<i>I have to tell her this directly!</i>

183
00:21:25,325 --> 00:21:26,326
I'm home!

184
00:21:27,077 --> 00:21:29,912
Whoa, there. What's the hurry?

185
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:32,833
- Where's Chinatsu Senpai?
- She already left.

186
00:21:35,419 --> 00:21:37,796
Her parents' flight
arrived ahead of schedule.

187
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:40,424
Your dad just took her to the airport.

188
00:21:43,552 --> 00:21:46,221
Why?

189
00:21:52,060 --> 00:21:54,896
<i>Why couldn't she just be here?</i>

190
00:23:48,927 --> 00:23:53,932
{\an8}Subtitle translation by: Zensho Yamamoto

